  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Holy Trinity Peace Village, Kuron, Diocese of Torit.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant will go towards support of the Holy Trinity Peace Village Kuron to support the establishment of safe water point with installation of sub-miscible solar pump, with PVC pipes and water tank which will result in supporting the peace village initiatives of:
1. Programme for youth, women and cattle raiders towards peaceful co-existence
2. Training of community police to maintain peace and order amongst the community.
3. Training youth and women at the youth centre on vocational skills.</narrative>
  </description>
